  "_test": "Can you describe it without saying what it is for? If yes it is a source or an operator.",
  "_note": "Each domain declares a default tier and lists only the entries that differ. Same machinery can be an operator in one domain and a generator in another — Voronoi is an operator in `primitives` and a generator in `art2d`, where the diagram itself is the artefact. Classified by how the entry is framed, not by the underlying maths.",

